			"notes": {
				"rationale": "sich fills the accusative slot of vorstellen 'introduce' (E-VALBU vorstellen, Lesart 2, Kakk often sich), which takes any object in the same sense (er stellt seine Frau vor), so the reflexive alternates and is a PRON of its own (de/verb-owns-its-scattered-members). E-VALBU's reflexive entry vorstellen, sich is the dative 'imagine' only."
